hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"219","Narrated by Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, narrated by Sufyan, on the authority of Asim. H. Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawraqi told us, Marwan Al-Fazari told us, Asim Al-Ahwal told us. H. Sallam bin Junada, narrated to us Hafs bin Ghayath, narrated to us on the authority of Asim. H Al-Sana'ani told us, Khalid, meaning Ibn Al-Harith, Shu'bah, Asim told me, he said: I heard Abu Al-Mutawakkil telling me, on the authority of Abu Saeed, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If one of you has intercourse with his family, then wants to return, let him perform ablution.” This is the hadith of Al-San’ani, and others said: On the authority of Abu Al-Mutawakkil"
